Aura Engine is a Windows port of Aura:

  Aura - https://github.com/antwny/aura
  Copyright (C) antwny and contributors
  Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later (as declared in its Cargo.toml).

Aura Engine is an **unofficial port** and is not affiliated with or endorsed
by the original Aura project.

The original Aura source was used as the reference for this port. The
Windows implementation, WorkerW hosting, mpv integration, egui interface
and CLI are new code, while some modules (notably the MotionBGS catalog
parser and the palette extraction algorithm) are adapted from the
original GPL-3.0-or-later code.

mpv is NOT bundled with Aura Engine. Aura may download an mpv build at
runtime from https://github.com/shinchiro/mpv-winbuild-cmake. mpv is
licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later (some parts LGPL-2.1-or-later); its source
is at https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv. When mpv is downloaded, its own
license and source terms apply.

